<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (This audit was conducted by Mahin on 26-05-2026 for the DEHIX Web3 freelance and identity ecosystem. The assessment covered multiple smart contracts related to escrow management, staking systems, treasury fee handling, and Soulbound Token infrastructure. The review process included manual security analysis along with automated tooling such as Slither and Aderyn.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (During the review, several High and Medium severity vulnerabilities were identified. The most critical findings included Soulbound Token transfer bypasses, escrow voting replay risks, fee-on-transfer accounting desynchronization issues, and denial-of-service vectors caused by unbounded loops. These issues could potentially lead to unauthorized token transfers, locked funds, governance manipulation, and protocol instability if not properly mitigated.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
