/T (Avoid iterating through unbounded arrays to execute transfers. Instead of transferring all tokens automatically in a single transaction, implement a pull-based withdrawal pattern where users claim individual tokens, or enforce a strict configuration limit on the maximum number of unique tokens permitted per escrow contract \(e.g., require\(e.tokens.length <= 5, "TooManyTokens"\);\).)
/E (Avoid iterating through unbounded arrays to execute transfers. Instead of transferring all tokens automatically in a single transaction, implement a pull-based withdrawal pattern where users claim individual tokens, or enforce a strict configuration limit on the maximum number of unique tokens permitted per escrow contract \(e.g., require\(e.tokens.length <= 5, "TooManyTokens"\);\).)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
